{
  "_readme": "Source of truth for the animated set. scripts/icons/build-lottie.mjs reads the licensed originals from the packs folder given on the command line, recolours them to SK tokens, strips and minifies them into src/assets/lottie/<name>.json, and writes the `animated` list in design/icons/icon-manifest.json and the table in design/icons/animated/README.md. `screens` are canvas screens whose mapped files must use the animation (check-icons enforces it); `uses` says where else it is wired. `rest` is the progress (0-1) shown when motion is reduced. Icons are single-ink: every colour becomes @ink, which the component fills from its `color` prop.",
